# url-test corpus (TEST-ONLY, step 4.3 U19, docs/plan/steps/11-url-protection.md): served by the
# CoreDNS `hosts` plugin for the zones listed in the Corefile block "URL protection corpus".
# Every web name resolves to the url-test container (urltest network, TEST-NET-3 203.0.113.10);
# the *-a.test / *-v6.test names resolve to internal addresses for the SSRF suites (nothing ever
# listens there: the guard must refuse them before connecting).
# The Cyrillic homoglyph exаmplebank.test (U+0430 at position 3) is its A-label
# xn--exmplebank-0qi.test (WHATWG/UTS #46, verified with node:url domainToASCII).
# clean-site.test (apex, www, wildcard) is a zone file: clean-site.test.db.
203.0.113.10 short-link.test redirect-chain.test
203.0.113.10 evil-site.test phish-login.test collector-site.test
203.0.113.10 examplebank.test examp1ebank.test examplebank-login.test xn--exmplebank-0qi.test
203.0.113.10 new-domain.test rdap.test
203.0.113.10 slow-site.test trickle-site.test huge-site.test many-headers.test gzip-bomb.test
203.0.113.10 evil-dbl.test malware-dbl.test
